WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.291 --> 00:00:04.814
Hey guys! 
Are you ready to dance like a toy&nbsp;robot?

00:00:04.814 --> 00:00:07.446
Whoa! Alright, let's put it together!

00:00:07.446 --> 00:00:11.291
First start with the body 
and shake it side to side

00:00:12.334 --> 00:00:16.657
Then we put our head on top
and we screw it on tight

00:00:17.126 --> 00:00:21.574
Now we click our arms in place
and we swing them out wide

00:00:21.731 --> 00:00:26.230
Then attach our legs
and they're feeling alright

00:00:26.390 --> 00:00:29.901
Now there's only one thing left to do...

00:00:29.901 --> 00:00:31.408
Press the button and DANCE!

00:00:31.408 --> 00:00:32.857
I'm a robot

00:00:33.888 --> 00:00:36.079
I'm a dancing robot

00:00:36.253 --> 00:00:37.836
I'm a robot

00:00:38.348 --> 00:00:40.067
I'm a dancing robot

00:00:40.067 --> 00:00:44.050
I can feel the music in my bolts and gears

00:00:45.122 --> 00:00:49.831
I'm a robot
and I love to dance, dance, dance

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:52.834
Oh, we're out of battery! 
Gotta recharge!

00:00:52.834 --> 00:00:56.866
Charge&nbsp;up with your right arm, 
spin it round and round

00:00:57.475 --> 00:01:01.943
Then charge with your left arm,
spin it round and round

00:01:02.124 --> 00:01:06.684
Now touch your toes,
going up and down

00:01:06.684 --> 00:01:11.003
Then we get wound up
by spinning round and round

00:01:11.379 --> 00:01:14.834
Now there's only one thing left to do...

00:01:14.834 --> 00:01:16.384
Press the button and DANCE!

00:01:16.384 --> 00:01:17.968
I'm a robot

00:01:18.835 --> 00:01:20.955
I'm a dancing robot

00:01:21.233 --> 00:01:22.491
I'm a robot

00:01:23.270 --> 00:01:25.156
I'm a dancing robot

00:01:25.156 --> 00:01:29.066
I can feel the music in my bolts and gears

00:01:29.634 --> 00:01:34.640
I'm a robot
and I love to dance, dance, dance

00:01:34.640 --> 00:01:36.931
Oh, we're out of battery again!

00:01:36.931 --> 00:01:38.830
But I see some&nbsp;supercharged batteries!

00:01:38.830 --> 00:01:41.130
Let's grab one and get powered up!

00:01:41.839 --> 00:01:43.031
Ah, there we go!

00:01:43.031 --> 00:01:45.250
There's another one!
Go&nbsp;on, grab it!

00:01:46.131 --> 00:01:47.833
Oh! Another one!

00:01:48.775 --> 00:01:50.348
There's another one!

00:01:51.833 --> 00:01:52.733
There we go!

00:01:55.409 --> 00:01:57.333
Now we're really charged up!

00:01:58.328 --> 00:01:59.557
SPEED DANCE!

